<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tenses & Daily Sentences - Kids App</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ffcc00;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #00ffcc;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-top: 35px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #00ffcc;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        h3 {
            color: #3399ff;
            text-align: left;
            margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        p.subtitle {
            color: #cccccc;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .content-box {
            background: #252525;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .list-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .sentence-card {
            background: #2d2d2d;
            border: 2px solid #444;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            text-align: left;
        }
        .sentence-card:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
            background: #3d3d3d;
        }
        .sentence-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .sentence-nepali {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #aaaaaa;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #ffcc00;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .speaker-icon {
            font-size: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>🌟 Tenses & Daily Sentences App 🌟</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Tap any rule or sentence to hear it spoken! (सुन्नको लागि टच गर्नुहोस्)</p>

    <!-- LESSON 3: TENSES -->
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
        
        <h2>Lesson 3: Tenses (समयको ज्ञान)</h2>
        <p style="color: #ccc; font-size: 14px;">Tenses show the time of an action.</p>

        <!-- 1. Present Tense -->
        <div class="content-box">
            <h3>1. Present Tense (वर्तमान काल)</h3>
            <p><i>Actions that happen now or every day.</i></p>
            
            <p><b>• Simple Present Tense:</b> (Habits, daily routines, general truths)</p>
            <p style="margin-left: 10px;"><span class="highlight">Formula:</span> Subject + Verb (s/es) + Object</p>
            <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <li onclick="speakWord('I go to school.')" style="cursor: pointer;">I go to school. (म स्कुल जान्छु।) 🔊</li>
                <li onclick="speakWord('He plays football.')" style="cursor: pointer; margin-top: 5px;">He plays football. (ऊ फुटबल खेल्छ।) 🔊</li>
            </ul>

            <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><b>• Present Continuous Tense:</b> (Actions happening right now)</p>
            <p style="margin-left: 10px;"><span class="highlight">Formula:</span> Subject + is/am/are + Verb(ing) + Object</p>
            <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <li onclick="speakWord('I am reading a book.')" style="cursor: pointer;">I am reading a book. (म किताब पढ्दै छु।) 🔊</li>
                <li onclick="speakWord('She is singing a song.')" style="cursor: pointer; margin-top: 5px;">She is singing a song. (उनी गीत गाउँदै छिन्।) 🔊</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Past Tense -->
        <div class="content-box">
            <h3>2. Past Tense (भूत काल)</h3>
            <p><i>Actions that already happened in the past.</i></p>
            
            <p><b>• Simple Past Tense:</b> (Actions finished in the past)</p>
            <p style="margin-left: 10px;"><span class="highlight">Formula:</span> Subject + Verb (V2) + Object</p>
            <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <li onclick="speakWord('I went to school yesterday.')" style="cursor: pointer;">I went to school yesterday. (म हजो स्कुल गएँ।) 🔊</li>
                <li onclick="speakWord('He played cricket.')" style="cursor: pointer; margin-top: 5px;">He played cricket. (उसले क्रिकेट खेल्यो।) 🔊</li>
            </ul>

            <p style="margin-top: 15px;"><b>• Past Continuous Tense:</b> (Actions continuing in the past)</p>
            <p style="margin-left: 10px;"><span class="highlight">Formula:</span> Subject + was/were + Verb(ing) + Object</p>
            <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <li onclick="speakWord('I was eating an apple.')" style="cursor: pointer;">I was eating an apple. (म स्याउ खाँदै थिएँ।) 🔊</li>
                <li onclick="speakWord('They were playing.')" style="cursor: pointer; margin-top: 5px;">They were playing. (तिनीहरू खेल्दै थिए।) 🔊</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Future Tense -->
        <div class="content-box">
            <h3>3. Future Tense (भविष्य काल)</h3>
            <p><i>Actions that will happen in the coming time.</i></p>
            
            <p><b>• Simple Future Tense:</b> (Actions that will happen later)</p>
            <p style="margin-left: 10px;"><span class="highlight">Formula:</span> Subject + will + Verb + Object</p>
            <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
                <li onclick="speakWord('I will go to Pokhara tomorrow.')" style="cursor: pointer;">I will go to Pokhara tomorrow. (म भोलि पोखरा जानेछु।) 🔊</li>
                <li onclick="speakWord('She will write a letter.')" style="cursor: pointer; margin-top: 5px;">She will write a letter. (उनी पत्र लेख्नेछिन्।) 🔊</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Tense Quiz Tip -->
        <div class="content-box" style="border-left: 4px solid #ffcc00;">
            <h3 style="color: #ffcc00; margin-top: 0;">App Exercise / Quiz Tip for Kids:</h3>
            <p>1. Yesterday, I <span class="highlight">_____</span> (go/went) to the park.<br>👉 <b>Answer:</b> went</p>
            <p>2. Now, she is <span class="highlight">_____</span> (eat/eating) an apple.<br>👉 <b>Answer:</b> eating</p>
        </div>


        <!-- LESSON 4: DAILY CONVERSATION SENTENCES -->
        <h2>Lesson 4: Daily Conversation Sentences</h2>
        <p style="color: #ccc; font-size: 14px;">Common sentences we use every day at home and school:</p>

        <h3>1. Greetings & Politeness (अभिवादन र शिष्टाचार)</h3>
        <div class="list-container">
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Good morning!')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Good morning!</div><div class="sentence-nepali">शुभ प्रभात!</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Good afternoon!')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Good afternoon!</div><div class="sentence-nepali">नमस्कार / शुभ दिन!</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Thank you.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Thank you.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">धन्यवाद।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Please.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Please.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">कृपया।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Sorry.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Sorry.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">माफ गर्नुहोला।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('How are you?')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">How are you?</div><div class="sentence-nepali">तपाईंलाई कस्तो छ?</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('I am fine, thank you.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">I am fine, thank you.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">मलाई सन्चो छ, धन्यवाद।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3>2. Classroom & School Sentences (स्कुलमा बोल्ने वाक्यहरू)</h3>
        <div class="list-container">
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('May I come in, Sir or Madam?')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">May I come in, Sir/Madam?</div><div class="sentence-nepali">सर/म्याम, म भित्र आउन सक्छु?</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('May I go to the toilet?')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">May I go to the toilet?</div><div class="sentence-nepali">म शौचालय जान सक्छु?</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Open your book.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Open your book.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">तपाईंको किताब खोल्नुहोस्।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Listen to the teacher.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Listen to the teacher.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">शिक्षकको कुरा सुनुहोस्।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('I do not understand.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">I don't understand.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">मैले बुझिनँ।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3>3. Home & Daily Life Sentences (घरमा बोल्ने वाक्यहरू)</h3>
        <div class="list-container" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('I am hungry.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">I am hungry.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">मलाई भोक लागेको छ।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Give me some water, please.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Give me some water, please.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">कृपया मलाई पानी दिनुहोस्।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('I am going to play.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">I am going to play.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">म खेल्न जाँदैछु।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('Good night, Mom and Dad.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">Good night, Mom and Dad.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">शुभ रात्रि, बुवा र आमा।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sentence-card" onclick="speakWord('I love my family.')">
                <div><div class="sentence-text">I love my family.</div><div class="sentence-nepali">म मेरो परिवारलाई माया गर्छु।</div></div>
                <div class="speaker-icon">🔊</div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        function speakWord(text) {
            if ('speechSynthesis' in window) {
                window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
                let utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);
                utterance.lang = 'en-US';
                utterance.rate = 0.9;
                window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);
            } else {
                alert("Speech synthesis not supported in this browser.");
            }
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>
